<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτο-βόλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>budding, fresh</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥβη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.217
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέφαρα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.61
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in course of shedding the first</i> or <i>milk teeth</i>, of
			horses (intermediate between <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβολος</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντιβόλος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.115
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Anatolian Studies</u>
				204
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Pisidia</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμηλος, ὄνος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				468.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				92.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> proparox. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτόβολος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, 
				Pass.
			, <i>first struck</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέρμονα π. ἁλίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1068
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
